 "title": "Strict transform over the complement of the center",
 "statement": "Let $X'\\to X$ be the blow-up of a center $C\\hookrightarrow X$. Over\n$X\\setminus C$, the strict transform is canonically the ordinary pullback.\nThis identification is compatible with the projection to the original\nscheme.",
 "source": {
  "document": "literature/blueprint/master/blueprint/sec-nagata-compactification/sk-prop-nagata-sketch-prepared/lemma-nagata-strict-transform-restrict.md",
